  <!-- macOS Capitalization Policy (go/chrome-capitalization):
       In-browser UI surfaces (such as the 3-dot app menu) use sentence
       case cross-platform, including on macOS. Native macOS surfaces
       (system menu bar and right-click context menus) follow Apple Human
       Interface Guidelines (HIG) and use Title Case (e.g. `_MAC`
       variants). -->
